OL,3,GNEWSAPrincess Anne meets Sinfield on
OL,4,Aday two of MND run
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Kevin Sinfield was greeted by the
OL,7,FPrincess Royal on the second day of his
OL,8,Ffinal annual endurance challenge
OL,9,Fraising money for motor neurone disease
OL,10,F(MND) charities.
OL,12,FThe rugby league legend and fundraiser
OL,13,Fis aiming to complete seven
OL,14,Fultramarathons in seven days, inspired
OL,15,Fby close friend and former teammate Rob
OL,16,FBurrow, who died in 2024 after living
OL,17,Fwith MND for more than four years.
OL,19,FRunning between Hull and Manchester,
OL,20,Fthe challenge will see him visit all 12
OL,21,FSuper League clubs before arriving at
OL,22,Fthe Grand Final on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
